    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513900/extras/b9cdb8cb286661e1aa516b91fd6ddd7d.poster.avif?t=1753412550\" width=528 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513900/extras/b9cdb8cb286661e1aa516b91fd6ddd7d.webm?t=1753412550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use mining drills to gather ores and smelt them to gain building materials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513900/extras/8536cd0b8d7ab4fe643711a76125b045.poster.avif?t=1753412550\" width=662 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513900/extras/8536cd0b8d7ab4fe643711a76125b045.webm?t=1753412550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Defend your mining site from waves of disgusting hostile alien creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513900/extras/fc942cbcda8af3c586c86b0e4519dce9.poster.avif?t=1753412550\" width=550 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513900/extras/fc942cbcda8af3c586c86b0e4519dce9.webm?t=1753412550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt your defenses to special alien abilities, daytime and biome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513900/extras/6de1f418ded3a03ac5077680a1f03d79.poster.avif?t=1753412550\" width=706 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513900/extras/6de1f418ded3a03ac5077680a1f03d79.webm?t=1753412550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research new technology to expand your arsenal of passive and active buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513900/extras/d6a2f9de0134a934f24a42ddb7ef376a.webp?t=1753412550\" width=706 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No asset flip / low effort game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No generative AI used</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo developer with lots of love and passion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No mixels :)</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513900/extras/b9cdb8cb286661e1aa516b91fd6ddd7d.poster.avif?t=1753412550\" width=528 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513900/extras/b9cdb8cb286661e1aa516b91fd6ddd7d.webm?t=1753412550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use mining drills to gather ores and smelt them to gain building materials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513900/extras/8536cd0b8d7ab4fe643711a76125b045.poster.avif?t=1753412550\" width=662 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513900/extras/8536cd0b8d7ab4fe643711a76125b045.webm?t=1753412550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Defend your mining site from waves of disgusting hostile alien creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513900/extras/fc942cbcda8af3c586c86b0e4519dce9.poster.avif?t=1753412550\" width=550 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513900/extras/fc942cbcda8af3c586c86b0e4519dce9.webm?t=1753412550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt your defenses to special alien abilities, daytime and biome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513900/extras/6de1f418ded3a03ac5077680a1f03d79.poster.avif?t=1753412550\" width=706 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513900/extras/6de1f418ded3a03ac5077680a1f03d79.webm?t=1753412550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research new technology to expand your arsenal of passive and active buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513900/extras/d6a2f9de0134a934f24a42ddb7ef376a.webp?t=1753412550\" width=706 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No asset flip / low effort game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No generative AI used</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo developer with lots of love and passion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No mixels :)</p></li></ul>",
